# Dependencies
# 尾斜杠只匹配目录，匹配不到同名的**软链**（软链在 git 眼里是文件）。
# 2026-08-27 在临时 worktree 里软链依赖目录跑测试，`git add -A` 把
# cds/node_modules 与 cds/web/node_modules 两个软链提交了进去，四条 CI 全红。
# 两条都写，目录与软链一起挡。
node_modules/
node_modules
.pnpm-store/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
bin/
obj/
target/

**/bin-buildcheck*/
**/obj-buildcheck*/
**/target-buildcheck*/

# Local build/check artifacts (generated by buildcheck/objcheck tooling)
artifacts/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Rust
Cargo.lock
*.rs.bk

# Track Tauri app lockfile for reproducible CI/builds
!prd-desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# .NET
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb

# Test results
TestResults/
coverage/

# Generated test images
**/GeneratedImages/

# Misc
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Tauri icons (generated from prd-desktop/icon.png)
prd-desktop/src-tauri/icons/

# Tauri updater signing key (private key - never commit)
prd-desktop/src-tauri/tauri-updater.key

# Local Development / Setup
mongodb/
mongo_data/
setup_*.sh
start_mongo.sh
**/output/

__pycache__/

# Claude Code local config (machine-specific, not shareable)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/launch.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Codex desktop local environments (machine-specific and may contain credentials)
.Codex/environments/

# CDS runtime state (contains env secrets, port allocations, container status)
# When CDS runs from the repo root it creates /.cds/ and /.cds-worktrees/
# there; when it runs from cds/ it creates cds/.cds/. Ignore both locations
# so `git status` stays clean regardless of how exec_cds.sh is invoked.
/.cds/
/.cds-data/
/.cds-cache/
/.cds-worktrees/
.cds/state.json
cds/.cds/
cds/.cds-repos/
cds/.cds-worktrees/
cds/cds.log
cds/.cds.env
cds/.cds.env.bak
cds/.cds.env.*.bak
# CDS nginx — everything under cds/nginx/ is generated at runtime
cds/nginx/
cds/nginx/nginx.conf
cds/nginx/cds-site.conf
cds/nginx/nginx.compose.yml
cds/nginx/certs/
cds/nginx/www/

# Agent development workspace (per-developer progress tracking)
.agent-workspace/

# Local Codex/agent skill mirrors (machine-specific, generated locally)
.agents/skills/*
# 项目级原型导出技能由仓库维护，统一源头剪枝与上传前预检
!.agents/skills/prototype-export/
!.agents/skills/prototype-export/**
# 项目级主题风险治理技能由仓库维护，供不同宿主的开发代理复用
!.agents/skills/reduce-adaptive-theme-risk/
!.agents/skills/reduce-adaptive-theme-risk/**
# skills-CLI 安装的第三方技能在 .claude/skills 下生成的 symlink（指向 .agents，本地产物）
# 真实可复现记录在 skills-lock.json；新容器跑 `npx skills update` 恢复
.claude/skills/ux-heuristics

# 验收报告/截图本地退化产物——归档走知识库，不入库（2026-06-12 清理）
doc/acceptance/

# 对比度审计的扫描产物（截图 + 报告），跑一次 e2e/theme-contrast-audit-local.mjs 就能重生成，不入库
.audit-contrast-local/

# 对比度审计每轮产出的截图与报告，属临时产物：跑一次脚本即重生成，不入库
.audit-*/

# 对比度审计产物（截图 + report.json/md）：跑一次脚本即重生成，不该进仓库。
# 之前只忽略了具体几个目录名，换个 AUDIT_OUT 就漏，于是 116 个文件 23MB 被提交进来
# （Codex 在 PR #1374 抓到）。改成前缀通配，堵住所有 .audit-* 变体。
.audit-*/
